    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d270">

                <pb facs="0398" n="318" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg318"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hart to Mr. Hay</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-08-10"><hi rendition="#italic">August 10,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Referring to Department’s telegraphic instructions<anchor n="a" xml:id="d270-f1"
                    /> concerning the protection of Cuban citizens and interests by United States
                    consular officers, Mr. Hart reports that the Colombian Government has notified
                    him that it grants the request, and will instruct governors accordingly. United
                    States consular officers have been instructed by telegraph by Mr. Hart.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
